}
```

```java
public void addReading(Reading r) {
    int i = 0;
    while (i < readings.size() && readings.get(i).getDay() < r.getDay()) {
        i++;
    }
    readings.add(i, r);
}
```

```java
public int emptyInRow(int row) {
    int count = 0;
    for (int c = 0; c < seats[row].length; c++) {
        if (seats[row][c] == 0) {
            count++;
        }
    }
